# Demo Interface Guidelines

## Gradio Application
Main demo interface: [demo/app.py](mdc:demo/app.py)

## Features
- **Layout Generation**: Interactive layout generation with spatial guidance
- **Background Generation**: AI-powered background creation
- **Sample Images**: Pre-loaded samples in [demo/samples/](mdc:demo/samples/)
- **Real-time Visualization**: Spatial guidance and bounding box visualization

## Interface Components
- **Input Controls**: Dataset selection, task type, encoder choice
- **Spatial Guidance**: Saliency, Intent Map, or Both
- **Visualization**: Final output, spatial guidance, bounding boxes
- **Examples**: Pre-configured examples using sample images

## Sample Images
- **CGL Samples**: [demo/samples/cgl/](mdc:demo/samples/cgl/)
- **PKL Samples**: [demo/samples/pkl/](mdc:demo/samples/pkl/)

## Configuration Options
- **Datasets**: pku, cgl
- **Tasks**: uncond, c, cwh, complete
- **Encoders**: vit, swin, convnext
- **Spatial Guidance**: Saliency, Intent Map, Both

## Running the Demo
```bash
cd demo
python app.py
```

## Integration
- Connects to main model pipeline
- Uses same configuration system as training
- Supports all model variants and datasets